<title>UK: Wlm Holdings has 50.94 pct of Chubb.</title>
<headline>Wlm Holdings has 50.94 pct of Chubb.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>British security firm Williams Holdings said on Monday that it had received acceptances with respect to 50.94 percent of the shareholding in Chubb Security as of March 21.</p>
<p>Williams said it had received acceptances in respect of 143.9 million Chubb shares. The company said it was extending its offer to 1500 GMT on April 4.</p>
</text>
